1
00:00:03,189 --> 00:00:06,714
The General card holds options for every AI feature.

2
00:00:06,714 --> 00:00:12,669
Enable preemptive memory retrieval lets signed-in users' memory be searched and added before

3
00:00:12,669 --> 00:00:14,249
the model is called.

4
00:00:14,701 --> 00:00:20,999
Maximum iterations per request limits how many times the assistant may call tools in one answer.

5
00:00:20,999 --> 00:00:23,531
It is always capped at one hundred.

6
00:00:23,982 --> 00:00:29,557
Enable distributed caching lets the AI services cache answers on a shared cache.

7
00:00:29,557 --> 00:00:35,522
Enable OpenTelemetry sends AI requests to your monitoring tool, where it is supported.

